The window manager is currently embedded in `testground.js`. Dragging writes layout on every pointer event, windows have no resize controls, and clearing the desktop bypasses close cleanup. I’ll give one compositor ownership of window geometry, focus, and lifecycle, while preserving the existing window API for the teaching tools.

